  "lines": [
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "Fever dream high in the quiet of the night",
      "startTime": 5841,
      "endTime": 8298,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "You know that I caught it (Oh yeah, you're right, I want it)",
      "startTime": 8298,
      "endTime": 11511,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "Bad, bad boy shiny toy with a price",
      "startTime": 11511,
      "endTime": 13978,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "You know that I bought it (Oh yeah, you're right, I want it)",
      "startTime": 13978,
      "endTime": 16986,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "Killing me slow, out the window",
      "startTime": 16433,
      "endTime": 19108,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "I'm always waiting for you to be waiting below",
      "startTime": 19108,
      "endTime": 22076,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "Devils roll the dice, angels roll their eyes",
      "startTime": 22076,
      "endTime": 24749,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "What doesn't kill me makes me want you more",
      "startTime": 24749,
      "endTime": 27882,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "And it's new, the shape of your body, it's blue",
      "startTime": 27882,
      "endTime": 32289,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "The feeling I got and it's, ooh, whoa-oh",
      "startTime": 32289,
      "endTime": 36605,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "It's a cruel summer",
      "startTime": 36561,
      "endTime": 39383,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "It's cool, that's what I tell 'em",
      "startTime": 39383,
      "endTime": 42231,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "No rules in breakable heaven but, ooh, whoa-oh",
      "startTime": 42231,
      "endTime": 47866,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "It's a cruel summer with you",
      "startTime": 47866,
      "endTime": 51468,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "Hang your head low in the glow of the vending machine",
      "startTime": 53866,
      "endTime": 56948,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "I'm not dying (Oh yeah, you're right, I want it)",
      "startTime": 56948,
      "endTime": 59492,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "Say that we'll just screw it up in these trying times",
      "startTime": 59492,
      "endTime": 62465,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "We're not trying (Oh yeah, you're right, I want it)",
      "startTime": 62465,
      "endTime": 64920,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "So cut the headlights, summer's a knife",
      "startTime": 64291,
      "endTime": 67098,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "I'm always waiting for you just to cut to the bone",
      "startTime": 67098,
      "endTime": 70065,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "Devils roll the dice, angels roll their eyes",
      "startTime": 70065,
      "endTime": 72725,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "And if I bleed, you'll be the last to know",
      "startTime": 72725,
      "endTime": 75511,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "Oh, it's new, the shape of your body, it's blue",
      "startTime": 75511,
      "endTime": 80303,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "The feeling I got and it's, ooh, whoa-oh",
      "startTime": 80303,
      "endTime": 84546,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "It's a cruel summer",
      "startTime": 84546,
      "endTime": 87376,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "It's cool, that's what I tell 'em",
      "startTime": 87376,
      "endTime": 90217,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "No rules in breakable heaven but, ooh, whoa-oh",
      "startTime": 90217,
      "endTime": 95837,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "It's a cruel summer with you",
      "startTime": 95837,
      "endTime": 99417,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "I'm drunk in the back of the car",
      "startTime": 99384,
      "endTime": 101509,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "And I cried like a baby coming home from the bar, oh",
      "startTime": 101509,
      "endTime": 104815,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "Said, \"I'm fine,\" but it wasn't true",
      "startTime": 104815,
      "endTime": 107127,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "I don't wanna keep secrets just to keep you",
      "startTime": 107127,
      "endTime": 109981,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "And I snuck in through the garden gate",
      "startTime": 109981,
      "endTime": 112776,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "Every night that summer just to seal my fate, oh",
      "startTime": 112776,
      "endTime": 116130,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "And I scream, for whatever it's worth",
      "startTime": 116130,
      "endTime": 118600,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "\"I love you, ain't that the worst thing you ever heard?\"",
      "startTime": 118600,
      "endTime": 121953,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "He looks up, grinning like a devil",
